==Battleground==
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*30 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mobius (Enemy)|Mobius]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Belial (Enemy)|Belials]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**3 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The easy, profitable start off can be used to stack up large numbers of slow [[Anti-Floating Cats]] to kill two of the special event enemies quickly, or general attackers to deal with the support, with higher HP values being useful since outranging Mobius is difficult. Otherwise sending out attackers and Meatshields like normal will kill the stage, along with any accrued stacks, and even if pushed back the enemies will still filleted away as they advance.

